:: School Swimming Late Wait
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "pool">><<schooleffects>><<effects>>

당신은 의자에 앉는다.
<<if $exposed gte 2>>
	<<if $swimall isnot 1>>
		<<if hasSexStat("exhibitionism", 5)>>
			당신의 노출된 <<genitalsandbreasts is are>>【이가】 반 전체에 전시된다.<<arousal 600>>
		<<else>>
			당신은 노출된 <<genitalsandbreasts>>【을를】 손으로 가린다.<<arousal 300>><<stress 1>>
